# The glade's start piece (#57): a disc of radius 2 where players 1 to 4 begin, open on three
# sides. Format: see Region.parse (sim/region.gd); a connector is a ground tile on the edge and the
# side it opens to.
origin 4 2
  . . .
 . . . .
. . 1 . .
 . 2 . 3
  . 4 .
connector 2 0 0
connector -2 0 3
connector 0 -2 2
